// The stage plugin protocol (decisions 67 to 69).
//
// A stage plugin models the stages of one distribution at one version: for a
// collector distribution such as otelcol-contrib 0.139, its processors. The
// otelcov core runs the topology graph, follows lineage and reaches verdicts;
// it starts the plugin as a subprocess (hashicorp/go-plugin), calls Init once
// per run, Configure once per stage instance, then Apply with batches of
// units.
